<title>USA: Bucyrus says Armour Swanson named chairman.</title>
<headline>Bucyrus says Armour Swanson named chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bucyrus International Inc said Armour Swanson replaced John Stark as non-executive chairman of the board, effective April 30.</p>
<p>Stark will continue to serve as a director of the surface mining equipment manufacturing company.</p>
<p>Swanson is chief executive of Carolina Steel Corp, Bucyrus said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
